      <p style="color: #FFFFFF; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 2rem;">Buyers should demand certificate numbers, verify on databases, and walk away from vague claims. The cost of greenwashing is paid by future buyers — not the brands selling it today. Verification is the only path to credibility in 2026.</p>
      
      <p style="color: #FFFFFF; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 2rem;">Manufacturers building traceability infrastructure, investing in certification, and preparing for DPP requirements will be ready for 2027 regulatory compliance. Those waiting until the last minute will face rushed implementation and potential non-compliance. The industry is moving toward mandatory documentation — brands and manufacturers need to prepare now.</p>
      
